 "text": "..title\nA resolution appropriating to certain accounts for the benefit of the Nashville Department of Transportation and Multimodal Infrastructure (NDOT) and the Midtown Business Improvement District (MBID) the amount of Five Million, Seven Hundred Twenty Thousand Nine Hundred Eighty-Nine Dollars ($5,720,989).\n..body\nWHEREAS, the Metropolitan Council desires to appropriate to certain accounts for the benefit of the Nashville Department of Transportation and Multimodal Infrastructure (NDOT) and the Midtown Business Improvement District (MBID) the amount of Five Million, Seven Hundred Twenty Thousand Nine Hundred Eighty-Nine Dollars ($5,720,989) from the increased revenue of the GSD General Fund and the revenue of the MBID.\nNOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE COUNCIL OF THE METROPOLITAN GOVERNMENT OF NASHVILLE AND DAVIDSON COUNTY: \nSection 1. \tThat the following amounts from the revenue of the General Fund of the General Services District are hereby appropriated:\nPRIMARY EXPENDITURE ACCOUNT #\n\tACCOUNT DESCRIPTION\n\tAMOUNT\n\t\n\t1042141310.500000\n\tNDOT- Roadway Programs\n\t$4,189,900\n\t\n\t\n\tTOTAL\n\t$4,189,900\n\t\n\tSection 2. \tThat the appropriation in Section 1 is funded from the following source:\nREVENUE\nACCOUNT # \n\tACCOUNT DESCRIPTION\n\tAMOUNT\n\t\n\t1042141310.403308\n\tNDOT Right of Way Permits - Excavation\n\t$2,324,300\n\t\n\t1042141310.403320\n\tNDOT Right of Way Permits - Temporary Street Closure\n\t1,865,600\n\t\n\t \n\tTOTAL\n\t$4,189,900\n\t\n\tSection 3. \tThat the following amount from the revenue of the Midtown Business Improvement District (MBID) is hereby appropriated:\nPRIMARY EXPENDITURE ACCOUNT #\n\tACCOUNT DESCRIPTION\n\tAMOUNT\n\t\n\t1001702000.500000\n\tMidtown Business Improvement District (MBID) Programs\n\t$1,531,089\n\t\n\t\n\tTOTAL\n\t$1,531,089\n\t\n\t\nSection 4. \tThat the appropriation in Section 3 is funded from the following source:\nREVENUE\nACCOUNT # \n\tACCOUNT DESCRIPTION\n\tAMOUNT\n\t\n\t1001702000.401705\n\tMidtown Business Improvement District (MBID) - Assessment\n\t$1,531,089\n\t\n\t \n\tTOTAL\n\t$1,531,089\n\t\n\tSection 5. \tThat this resolution shall take effect from and after its adoption, the welfare of The Metropolitan Government of Nashville and Davidson County requiring it.\n..Agenda Analysis\nAnalysis\n\nThis resolution approves supplemental appropriations in the amount of $5,720,989 from revenues of various funds for the benefit of the Nashville Department of Transportation and Multimodal Infrastructure (“NDOT”) and the Midtown Central Business Improvement District.\n\nA total of $4,189,900 would be appropriated from revenue of the GSD General Fund, particularly NDOT right-of-way permits for excavation and temporary street closures, for the following purpose:\n\nNDOT Roadway Programs - $4,189,900.\n\nA total of $1,531,089 would be appropriated from the revenue of the Midtown Business Improvement District for the following purpose:\n\nMidtown Business Improvement District (MBID) Programs - $1,531,089.\n\n"
